| 有限命题 | 命令 | `real`（秒） |
| --- | --- | ---: |
| 三份 CNF 与独立 RUP/DRAT 核验 | `/usr/bin/time -p python3 -B tools/scripts/agent/openproblem/kneser-certificates.py --drat-trim "$DRAT_TRIM"` | 15.44 |
| 两幅映射及半群、克隆覆盖 | `/usr/bin/time -p python3 -B tools/scripts/agent/openproblem/kneser-embeddings.py` | 0.12 |
| 三个小参数的避免着色 | `/usr/bin/time -p python3 -B tools/scripts/agent/openproblem/kneser-sharpness.py` | 0.09 |
| \((9,5)\) 的等价消去与六集合子句 | `/usr/bin/time -p python3 -B tools/scripts/agent/openproblem/kneser-95-reduction.py` | 3.81 |

